{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29157","headline":"送段觉之西蜀结婚 · 许浑","name":"送段觉之西蜀结婚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"词赋名高身不闲，彩衣如锦度函关。\n镜中鸾影胡威去，剑外花归卫玠还。\n秋浪远侵黄鹤岭，暮云遥断碧鸡山。\n时人若问西游客，心在重霄鬓欲斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}